Subject: [PATCH] H2: gpuctl binds loopback and only pre-fills the control
 token for local browsers

---
 odysseus/gpuctl.py                     | 27 +++++++++++---
 odysseus/tests/test_gpuctl_h2_token.py | 49 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 71 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
